	quest.06BED8FFC050C39A.quest_desc: [
		"I discovered ruins in the Dark Forest. They were the remains of a fortress, usually owned by knights. However, this one was different: it was occupied by hordes of goblins. They wore knight armor, yet their behavior proved otherwise."
		"Deep inside lies a pedestal, once used to display trophies — symbols of power. With a powerful staff, I can weaken the forest’s curse. Placing a trophy on the pedestal will open the gate to the fortress."
	]
	quest.06BED8FFC050C39A.title: "Symbol of Strength"
