	quest.075C03D1410623B3.quest_desc: [
		"&6As millennia passed, the Starlight People grew immensely powerful and foresaw their destruction by colossal beings, believing them to be sent by the Overworld."
		""
		"&6Fearing extinction, they constructed massive defensive machines of immense power."
		""
		"&6But a rare Ether Rain corroded the machines, driving them berserk and causing havoc across the dimension..."
