	quest.07A93BC3CEA3D3D0.quest_desc: [
		"&dThe Starlight Dimension&6 is added by &dEternal Starlight&6."
		""
		"&dIts terrain resembles the Overworld;"
		"&6most biomes have blue vegetation,"
		"&6with purple starry skies mixed with warm twilight hues;"
		"&6it is divided into Gloomstone and Voidstone layers,"
		"&6like Stone and Deepslate in the Overworld;"
		"&6rich ores lie underground,"
		"&6supporting various magical tools and weapons."
		""
		"&dIt also features special weather: &eMeteor Showers&6."
		"&6Make a wish during one, and you may receive a gift."
	]
