	quest.113378DAACF3A395.quest_desc: [
		"Combat: Skilled at summoning magic, controlling enemies and confusing them."
		"Abilities:"
		"Magic: When its owner's health is low, the Illusionist will cast magic to hide its owner from enemies."
		"Decoy: When its health is low, it disappears and leaves behind an explosive duplicate to taunt nearby enemies."
		"Pickpocket: When no one is watching and there are &eGold Nuggets&r or &aEmeralds&r on the ground, this little trickster will steal them."
		"Spawning: &aIllusionist Familiar&r naturally disguises itself as other Overworld familiars. Use the &4Mirror of Truth&r to reveal them."
