		"&d&lDark Doppelganger"
		""
		"&6Craft a &5Shadow Orb&6 and throw it into the &5End Void&6 to summon it."
		""
		"&dThe Dark Doppelganger&6 is the manifestation of your inner darkness."
		"&dThe Dark Doppelganger&6 will &acopy&6 your attack and armor values when summoned,"
		"&dThe Dark Doppelganger&6 displays your own name."
