		"&c&lDark Doppelganger Boss Guide:"
		""
		"&dPhase One:"
		"&6Uses &emelee attacks&6 and &avarious elemental spells&6,"
		"&6Patrols the arena and precisely locks onto players."
		""
		"&dPhase Two:"
		"&6Releases stronger fire attacks,"
		"&6such as &cFireballs&6 and &cMagma Bombs&6, while summoning deadly &bLightning Strikes&6,"
		"&6and blinds nearby players to disrupt vision."
		""
		"&dPhase Three:"
		"&6Unleashes devastating skills,"
		"&6such as &eMeteor Shower&6, &8Gravity Pull&6, and &4Life Drain&6,"
		"&6plus &bLightning Strike&6, &9Freeze&6, &5Teleport&6, and more."
		""
		"&dExclusive Skills:"
		"&aLevitation Attack: &6Throws players high into the air and fires fireballs"
		"&aTeleport: &6Instantly teleports next to unaware players with eerie laughter"
		"&aMeteor Shower: &6Rains scorching destruction with explosions and lightning"
		"&aGravity Pull: &6Drags players toward the boss and deals massive damage"
	]
