	quest.1B240FEAC3D29C3B.quest_desc: [
		"&aObjective: Obtain any dragon egg"
		""
		"&eDragon Egg&6 is the only way to tame dragons in survival mode,"
		"&6Hatch the egg to get a tamed dragon hatchling."
		""
		"&6Dragon Eggs can be found in chests in the &eMother Dragon's Lair&6,"
		"&6or dropped by &efemale dragons level 4 and above&6 (0~3 eggs)."
		"&6Any dragon can breed; feed the corresponding breeding food,"
		"&6to start breeding two opposite-sex dragons of the same attribute."
		"&6After breeding, there is a 300-second cooldown; hatching takes 6 minutes."
		""
		"&cFire Dragon Egg: Hatch in fire"
		"&bIce Dragon Egg: Hatch in water"
		"&dLightning Dragon Egg: Hatch exposed to rain/thunder in the Overworld"
	]
