	quest.228FFCAF5D84CE5C.quest_desc: [
		"&aObjective: Defeat the Infernal Dragon"
		""
		"&6Later, that dimensional rift underwent a horrific mutation, and the corrupting force spread."
		"The Starlight People urgently closed the dimensional portal, abandoning the “Tower of Babel”."
		"&6Since then, the swamp became a forbidden land &eDark Swamp&6."
		"&6The Starlight Dimension guardian, the Starlight Dragon, decided to sacrifice itself, sealing the rift atop the tower alone."
		"&6Centuries passed, the Starlight People vanished, and the former guardian became the predatory &eInfernal Dragon&6."
		"{ \"text\": \"Click to view BOSS guide\", \"underlined\": true, \"color\": green, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"03B1663E1AEFE3E8\" } }"
		""
		"&7&oNote: Infernal Dragon is not a native BOSS of Eternal Starlight"
	]
