		"&6Right-click &ePrimordial Anchor&f to learn the &eSpiral Charge Skill&6,"
		"&6Use &d【V】&6 in flight mode to dash forward and deal damage."
		"&6If &ePrimordial Anchor&6 is inactive, use &eEnder Pearl&6 to activate."
