	quest.26D99EE35B3F2868.quest_desc: [
		"Combat: Specializes in Blood Magic, including Necromancy for summoning undead."
		"Abilities:"
		"Undead Chaos: Causes nearby undead to rampage, attacking nearby entities."
		"Wither: Turns nearby skeletons into Wither Skeletons."
		"Spawn: Found in &2Soul Sand Valley&r's &6Nether Cemetery&r for death research."
		"Food: Can be healed with Bones or Blood Bottles."
		""
		"&9Structure Compass: &b【Familiar】Nether Cemetery"
	]
	quest.26D99EE35B3F2868.title: "Necromancer Familiar"
	quest.27C667BFA15E8E67.quest_desc: [
		"Combat: Specializes in Lightning Magic, casting spells that hit multiple targets."
		"Abilities:"
		"Charge Owner: Can charge the owner, increasing speed and strength."
		"Charge Crawler: Every time it finds a creeper, it charges with it."
		"Spawn: Roams &2mountains&r seeking spots to attract lightning."
		"Food: Can be healed with Lightning Bottles."
	]
	quest.27C667BFA15E8E67.title: "Thunder Mage Familiar"
	quest.282FECD2B1F669AD.quest_subtitle: "Everything You Want to Know Is Here"
	quest.282FECD2B1F669AD.title: "Tea Ceremony Guide"
	quest.28625E49F473135B.quest_desc: [
		"&l&d\"The Gatekeeper\""
		"&6Health: &a2000"
		"&6Attack: &c65"
		"&6Armor: &715"
		""
		"&l&dSpawn"
		"&6In this modpack, serves as the final boss of the Twilight Forest &bEnd Castle&6."
		"&6Right-click the Gatekeeper to talk and select Challenge to start the battle."
		"&6Of course, other options provide additional player functions."
		""
		"&9Structure Compass: &bEnd Plateau Castle&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&l&dStrategy"
		"The same Gatekeeper can be challenged repeatedly,"
		"each successful challenge permanently increases all of its attack damage by 5%."
		"Damage bonuses have a cap, up to 3×."
		"Mercy Rule: If the Gatekeeper's next attack would kill a player, it immediately ceases combat."
		"When ceasing combat, the player's death is prevented, leaving minimal health and granting 10 seconds of invulnerability."
		""
		"&l&dSkills"
		"&l&eNormal Attack"
		"A basic melee strike, swings weapon to deal damage to the target;"
		"The Gatekeeper can move while attacking, this attack has a long wind-up;"
		"Normal attacks sometimes release sword projectiles toward the target, but these deal no damage and are purely visual;"
		"&l&e3-Hit / 4-Hit Combo"
		"Swings consecutively three / four times, each hit dealing damage;"
		"Note! This move rapidly consumes shield durability while blocking;"
		"The Gatekeeper can move during attacks, only the first and fourth hits have longer wind-ups;"
		"&l&eCharged Earthquake"
		"The Gatekeeper holds the weapon upright to charge, remaining stationary while creating strong suction around itself, pulling nearby entities closer;"
		"After charging, it slams the weapon into the ground, dealing damage and knockback;"
		"Earthquake damage can be avoided by jumping or blocked with a shield;"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&l&e3-Hit Combo + Earthquake"
		"Performs a special attack animation: after three normal attacks, follows with an Earthquake;"
		"Compared to 3-Hit / 4-Hit Combo, each swing has longer intervals and the Gatekeeper remains stationary;"
		"This Earthquake does not pull or knockback, easily avoided by shield or jump;"
		"&l&eCharge Slash"
		"After a short wind-up, the Gatekeeper dashes several blocks toward the target, dealing damage;"
		"This move is hard to dodge; blocking with a shield is the simplest and most effective counter;"
		"&l&eSummon Gatekeeper Fireball"
		"A short wind-up but long-lasting aerial projectile, the only ranged attack of the Gatekeeper;"
		"The fireball first ascends, then crashes down on the target's current location, destroying terrain and igniting ground;"
		"Other fireballs may be affected by knockback from the first explosion, scattering and exploding elsewhere;"
		"The Gatekeeper can perform other attacks immediately after summoning animation."
		"&l&eDodge"
		"Support skill: the Gatekeeper has a chance to sidestep 1–2 blocks when the player's crosshair is aimed at it."
		""
		"&o&7Source: www.mcmod.cn"
	]
	quest.28625E49F473135B.quest_subtitle: "★★★★"
	quest.28625E49F473135B.title: "Eternal Starlight: The Gatekeeper"
