	quest.2B5CAD5134FFA4AF.quest_desc: [
		"&aWelcome to&e『&6BeLoong&e』"
		"&6Here we introduce the core mod of this pack — &eDragon Survival&6."
		""
		"&eDragon Altar&6 is the core item, used to switch dragon species."
		"&6Place the Dragon Altar on the ground, right-click to open &eDragon Selection&6. Each dragon has unique &eSkills&6, &eTraits&6, weaknesses, and special &eRecipes&6."
		""
		"&6Click the &dDragon Head icon&6 at the top left to view detailed info of the species."
		"&6Click the rightmost arrow or use &dmouse wheel&6 to turn pages."
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/task/dragon_altar.png width:200 height:180 align:center}"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/task/dragon_editor.png width:200 height:100 align:center}"
		"&6After selecting a dragon, enter the &aDragon Editor&6."
		"&6The top shows the &aGrowth Stages&6, each stage with distinct appearance."
		"&6After editing, click &aApply to All Stages&6 at top left,"
		"&6then click &aConfirm&6 to start your &eBeLoong adventure&6!"
	]
