	quest.346F1B08A0E6345D.quest_desc: [
		"&5Spell Books &rneed to be equipped to use."
		"&aMethod 1&r: Hold the spell book and right-click to automatically equip it."
		"&aMethod 2&r: Click the &6Curios Slot &rat the top-left of the inventory to equip it."
		"&aCasting Method&r:"
		"1. Press &d【T】&r to open the &5Spell Wheel&r, and move the mouse to select a spell."
		"2. Press 【&dV】&r to cast the spell, which consumes &5Mana&r."
		""
		"&cNote: The key bindings have been modified in this modpack. If you are not used to them, please change them yourself!"
	]
