	quest.37DD5B8A42ABC578.title: "Vanilla: Ender Dragon"
	quest.37E22E2A0F31B536.quest_desc: [
		"&l&d「Netherite Ironclad」"
		"&6Health: &a1000"
		"&6Attack: &c64"
		"&6Armor: &78"
		""
		"&l&dSpawn"
		"&6It awaits adventurers who challenge it in the &bIronclad Arena &6in the Nether."
		"&6Mine the &eAncient Carved Blackstone &6from the central stone pillar to summon it."
		"&6You can use &eSulfur Nectar &6to reset the boss arena."
		""
		"&9Structure Compass: &b【Cataclysm】Ironclad Arena&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&l&dStrategy"
		"&cDamage can only be dealt by attacking the hitbox of its eye."
		"It is recommended to press F3+B to enable hitboxes while fighting."
		"When a player gets too close to the Netherite Ironclad, it will attempt to make a fist and cover its eye."
		"The Ironclad will only defend for 1 to 2 seconds before ceasing its defense."
		""
		"&l&dSkills"
		"&l&eColossal Fist Charge"
		"The Netherite Ironclad begins to clench its fist, covering its weak point, and charges toward its targeted player. Hitting a block during the charge causes a small explosion, which deals damage and destroys blocks. The charge lasts only a short time. Whether it hits its target or is blocked by blocks, after the charge ends it will open its palm, briefly exposing its eye, and slowly back away from its target."
		"&l&ePalm Eye Laser"
		"The Netherite Ironclad curls its fingers, the eye in its palm focuses on its target while emitting red particle effects, then fires a red laser. The laser continuously turns toward the target, dealing damage at a rate of once every 0.5 seconds upon impact. The laser can be blocked by blocks."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&l&eEmpowered Fist Charge"
		"A variant of the normal Colossal Fist Charge. Upon activation, the Netherite Ironclad spins, enveloped in a red glow. On impact, it creates a larger, more destructive explosion with extremely high, truly high damage. The surrounding area is left ablaze after the explosion."
		"It loses its empowerment after the first explosion, and subsequent impacts will have the effect of a normal Colossal Fist Charge."
		"&l&eCurse of Blindness"
		"The Netherite Ironclad turns its palm downward and wiggles its fingers, while eye effects surround the player. Upon completion, the player is afflicted with Blindness I for 7 seconds."
		""
		"&o&7Strategy Source: www.mcmod.cn"
	]
	quest.37E22E2A0F31B536.quest_subtitle: "★★★"
	quest.37E22E2A0F31B536.title: "Cataclysm: Netherite Ironclad"
	quest.37F1B7C8FF396C68.quest_desc: [
		"&eFlying Fish &6are flying creatures that only appear during &brainy or thunderous weather&6."
