	quest.434D3A47067493D8.quest_desc: [
		"The once most glorious knights have now decayed. They are closely linked to the arsenide surrounding the forest center. Their souls cannot rest, guarding this tomb day and night to prevent intruders."
		""
		"&cNote: Using magic attacks against Phantom Knights may not register as a kill. Please use physical attacks!"
	]
	quest.434D3A47067493D8.quest_subtitle: "The ancient and powerful knight civilization was once the most glorious in the Twilight Forest, but now they have declined."
