	quest.48BAABC889E9DC5F.quest_desc: [
		"&l&d「Lich of the Night」"
		"&6Health: &a1600"
		"&6Attack: &c48"
		"&6Armor: &70"
		""
		"&l&dSpawn"
		"&6Follow the guidance of a &eSoul Star &6to find the &bLich Tower&6."
		"&6Hold a &eSoul Star &6and &dright-click &6to activate the four &eGlyph Stone Altars&6."
		"&6The Lich of the Night will then be summoned in the outer ring of the Lich Tower."
		"&6The in-game time will be locked to night."
		"&6You can use &eSulfur Nectar &6to reset the boss arena."
		""
		"&9Structure Compass: &b【Cataclysm】Lich Tower&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&l&dStrategy"
		"Simply fly up and attack it with melee&o&7 (The easiest one to fight)"
		"The Lich of the Night will maintain a certain safe distance from the player and continuously fly in circles around them."
		"When the player gets too close, the Lich of the Night will teleport to a more suitable position."
		""
		"&l&dSkills"
		"&l&eFalling Star"
		"The Lich of the Night raises its staff, charges for a relatively long time, and then fires a \"Falling Star\" at the player. The \"Falling Star\" is affected by gravity. Upon hitting a block/entity, it explodes, destroying surrounding blocks with a force roughly equivalent to TNT. Damage is high; a direct hit can deal 30 to 40 points of damage or even more."
		"&l&eFrost Star"
		"The Lich of the Night waves its staff, and five points of light appear above its head. After a brief charge, these points turn into \"Frost Stars\" shot towards the player, dealing 48 damage to hit entities and inflicting Slowness III for 5 seconds."
		"The \"Frost Stars\" shot are projectiles with a parabolic trajectory, slowed down in water. They can be blocked by a shield, but the slowness effect is still applied upon successful block."
		"&l&eSummon Phantom"
		"The Lich of the Night raises its spellbook with its left hand, constructing a magic circle around the player. Once the circle is fully formed, a Phantom appears at its location."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&l&eEmpowered Attacks"
		"When the Lich of the Night's health bar drops to certain thresholds marked on the bar, it will erupt with soul particles, indicating that its next attack will be greatly empowered."
		"The empowered attacks are cast in a fixed sequence: Empowered Falling Star → Empowered Frost Star → Empowered Summon Phantom."
		"&l&eEmpowered Falling Star"
		"The Lich of the Night waves its arms widely, creating a ring of falling stars around itself. This ring continuously generates \"Falling Stars\" and fires them at the player as soon as they are formed."
		"The firing frequency is relatively fast, about once per second. After firing 6 Falling Stars total, the ring disappears, and the Lich prepares for the next empowered attack."
		"&l&eEmpowered Frost Star"
		"The Lich of the Night waves its arms widely, then continuously sends four waves of \"Frost Stars\" at the player. The four waves are arranged as: horizontal line, vertical line, cross shape, and \"X\" shape."
		"&l&eEmpowered Summon Phantom"
		"The Lich of the Night waves its arms widely, then continuously constructs 9 magic circles (the same as the normal Summon Phantom circles), effectively summoning 9 Phantoms in succession."
		""
		"&o&7Strategy Source: www.mcmod.cn"
	]
	quest.48BAABC889E9DC5F.quest_subtitle: "★★★"
	quest.48BAABC889E9DC5F.title: "Cataclysm: Lich of the Night"
