	quest.4F977202E988A26C.quest_desc: [
		"&3The Bard Familiar &6is the most difficult familiar to obtain."
		"&6First, you need to obtain the &eachievements &6for taming all other familiars."
		"&6After that, you must craft and open a &bMysterious Orb&6."
		"{ \"text\": \"Click to jump to Mysterious Orb introduction\", \"underlined\": true, \"color\": green, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"53F62FC8058F6AE7\" } }"
		"&6Then, near an &euntamed familiar&6,"
		"&6hold a &eHarp &6and cast a &3Spirit Law spell&6,"
		"&6making it fall in love with music and transform into a &3Bard Familiar&6."
		"&6Finally, use &bArcane Source &6to tame it,"
		"&6and use &eLost Melody &6to bind it."
		""
		"&rCombat: Excels in sound magic, attacking enemies with powerful melodies, but also supporting friends with auxiliary melodies."
		"Abilities:"
		"Musical Nature: It will play melodies to make adventures better."
		"Food: Can be healed using Music Discs."
	]
