	quest.4F9B70EE7BB0E995.quest_subtitle: "Can be smelted into Dragonsteel"
	quest.4FC2986473F06494.quest_desc: [
		"&aObjective: Defeat the Forgotten Guardian and craft the Forgotten Ingot"
		""
		"&eThe Abyssal Dwellers &6sacrificed countless brave warriors,"
		"&6finally defeating and sealing away the invading &eSkeleton King&6."
		"&6That &eUndergarden Lair &6became the dungeon imprisoning the &eSkeleton King&6."
		"&6To prevent the &eSkeleton King&6 from rising again, &ethe Abyssal Dwellers &6stationed heavy guards in the dungeon."
		"&6Even though their names are now forgotten, they remain steadfast in their duty."
		"&6Later generations called them &eForgotten Guardians&6."
		"&6It is said that the &2Forgotten Ingots &6that make up their armor"
		"&6are the key to resurrecting the &eSkeleton King&6!"
	]
	quest.4FC2986473F06494.quest_subtitle: "Their names are now unknown"
	quest.4FC2986473F06494.title: "Forgotten Guardian"
	quest.4FCCF9100795CFEB.title: "God among Gods"
	quest.5003D0EDCDBEB34E.quest_desc: [
		" In life, he must have been a wizard of considerable power. Fireball, Teleport, Summon - these spells were but minor tricks for dealing with uninvited guests. Such prowess deserves my recognition."
		" But when my dragon claws pierced his chest, which no longer held a heartbeat, the bonds he had forged in his past life - in the sweltering swamp, the dark forest, the snowy cold lands - were finally broken."
	]
	quest.5003D0EDCDBEB34E.quest_subtitle: "&7I hate the smell of decay"
	quest.5003D0EDCDBEB34E.title: "&bVile Undead"
