	quest.5083AFBE18C36085.quest_desc: [
		"&4The Heraldry system &6is equivalent to the spell systems of other mods (Iron's Spells, Cataclysm, etc.)."
		""
		"&6This system is self-contained. Although its completion is currently low, some spells can still be cast normally using the following operations."
		""
		"&6After unlocking your first heraldry:"
		""
		"&6Hold a &9Seer Orb &6and press the corresponding keybind (default: H) to cycle through selected heraldries."
		""
		"&6With no heraldry selected, hold the Seer Orb and long-press right-click to open the heraldry configuration screen."
		""
		"&6Passive heraldries need to be actively equipped (clicked) in the configuration screen to take effect."
		""
		"&6After selecting a heraldry, you also need to, according to the prompt on the configuration screen:"
		""
		"&6Keep a crystal corresponding to the spell's element type in your inventory (you don't need to prepare all corresponding crystals)."
	]
	quest.5083AFBE18C36085.title: "How to Use Heraldry Casting"
