	quest.52095C31FABA1ED2.quest_desc: [
		"&6The English translation of FTB Quests is generated by AI and may &ccontain inaccuracies!"
		"&6If you encounter any issues, please report them on &eGitHub."
		"https://github.com/PorkChop-ZLG/BeLoong/issues"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"①&3The &e【Deconstruction Table】 &6in the Twilight Forest is &cdisabled&6."
		"&eThe Deconstruction Table &6can easily yield materials that are normally hard to obtain,"
		"&6and also poses a risk of item duplication. It is &cdisabled by default&6."
		"&6If you have an unavoidable reason to use it, you can re-enable it in the config file."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		" ②&bC2ME (Concurrent Chunk Management Engine)"
		"&6This optimization mod can significantly &eimprove chunk loading speed&6,"
		"&6but has poor compatibility and may heavily utilize CPU."
		"&cIf you encounter chunk loading errors, you can remove it."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"③&a【Yes, Steve Model】 &6needs to be installed and used manually."
		"&aYSM models &6are incompatible with the dragon model and are &cdisabled by default&6."
		"&6To use it, find the following in the Dragon Survival config file:"
		"&eClient Settings - Rendering - Render Dragon in First Person , click Disable."
		"&6&6Then press &d【alt+Y】 &6to open the model selection screen,"
		"&6click the settings in the top-right corner, and uncheck &a\"Disable Self-Model Rendering\"&6."
		""
		"&6The &3\"Azure Dragon\" and \"Liber\" &6models included in the pack are free to use."
		"&6However, they &cmay not be redistributed or used for commercial purposes!"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"④&e【Distant Horizons】 &6needs to be enabled manually."
		"&eThe Distant Horizons mod &6requires a large amount of RAM and is &cdisabled by default&6."
		"&6To use it, enable the Distant Horizons mod in your launcher."
		"&6Once enabled, it will automatically generate terrain, causing significant lag."
		"&6It is recommended to allocate at least &224GB of RAM&6."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		" ⑤ &eThe Aether Dragon &6can transform into the dragon girl &3\"Azure Dragon\"&6,"
		"&eand the Tundra Dragon &6can transform into the dragon girl &b\"Liber\"&6."
		" &6The &aTransformation &6skill is unlocked upon reaching the &aAncient Dragon stage&6."
		""
		"&6If you encounter a &c【Missing Model】 &6issue,"
		"&6please open the &aSkin Editor Interface &6and click &aConfirm&6."
	]
