	quest.53A0BF6EAC599D29.quest_desc: ["A once very prosperous civilization flourished here, but you never witnessed it. Now, an eternal twilight shrouds this land. Only a few ruins, lush trees, and strange creatures remain in the forest. You are determined to unravel the mysteries of the Twilight Forest, but you soon discover that the ruins have new masters. Not all forest inhabitants are friendly to intruders! Find some &aTorchberries &rand &aRaven Feathers &rand combine them with &aGlowstone &rto craft a &dMagic Map Core"]
	quest.53A0BF6EAC599D29.quest_subtitle: "The nearby structures seem to emanate hostility"
	quest.53A0BF6EAC599D29.title: "&eA True Dragon Fears No Challenge"
	quest.53B131469820D741.quest_desc: [
		"&eMystia's Izakaya &6is a new addon for Farmer's Delight,"
		"&6allowing you to simulate running a restaurant."
		""
		"&6First, you need to craft a &aLedger&6."
		"&6Open the Ledger UI, click the background to turn the page. The two columns on the right are the menus. Pick up an item and click on the menu slots to set them."
		"&6Place Dining Tables on the ground and bind them using the Ledger with right-click."
		"&6Hold shift, right-click with the Ledger to open the UI, and click the &a\"Start/Stop Business\" &6button in the top-left. If configured correctly, a green &a\"Business started successfully\" &6message will appear in chat."
		"&6After a while, void customers will generate orders, displayed in the bottom-left corner of the screen. The order for that table will also be shown above the Dining Table. You can also complete orders by holding the target dish/drink and clicking on the floating UI."
		"&6Opening the Ledger will show you the income from the tables."
	]
	quest.53B131469820D741.quest_subtitle: "Can 『BeLoong』 also play business simulation?"
