	quest.56AEAD8720A0B3F9.quest_desc: [
		"&aObjective: Learn to fly, fly 1000 meters"
		""
		"&6As a dragon, &eflight &6is an essential skill to learn."
		"&6Press the &d【G】 &6key; a &ewing icon &6appearing in the top-right corner indicates flight is enabled."
		"&6Normal flight mode is the same as &eCreative flight&6."
		"&6Hold &d【Ctrl】 &6and &d【W】 &6to accelerate, just like &eElytra flight&6."
		"&6While doing so, &ntilting your view up&r&6 allows for vertical flight, soaring into the sky."
		""
		"&cNote: Flying consumes a lot of hunger; do not fly for extended periods!"
	]
