		""
		"&6When a dragon attacks villagers or guild members, you gain the &dBounty Hunt &6effect."
		"&6While under this effect, you cannot trade with villagers, but you can &cPillage &6a Villager with a profession by pressing &d【Right-click】&6."
		"&6While &dUnder Bounty Hunt&6, there's a chance for &eScout &6squads to spawn and try to arrest you!"
		""
		"&dUnder Bounty Hunt &6cannot be removed with milk or death; you must wait for the duration to end."
		"&6The quest book provides a &c【Clear Bounty Hunt】 &6item that can be used to remove the effect."
	]
