	quest.5BB4A81605A76537.quest_desc: [
		"&aObjective: Obtain the completion certificates for all dragons"
		"&aObjective: Complete all main quests (side stories not included)"
		""
		"&6Even the longest road has an end; the BeLoong journey concludes here."
		"&6All the trials and tribulations along the way have crystallized into precious memories."
		""
		"&7The wonder of first transforming into a dragon; the surprise of revisiting the Twilight Forest;"
		"&7The fateful encounter with Eternal Starlight; the terror of escaping The Undergarden."
		""
		"&cThe fire of the cave, burning all in its path; &2The mist of the forest, reviving the land;"
		"&9The lightning of the sea, roaring thunder and crashing waves; &fThe snow of the tundra, freezing a thousand miles;"
		"&3The wind of the aether, purifying the four poles; &eThe Azure Dragon's spirit, a majestic righteousness."
		""
		"&d\"A golden scale was never meant to dwell in a pond; meeting wind and cloud, it transforms into a dragon.\""
		"&d\"The dragon's roar shakes the heavens in the ninth cloud; wind and cloud converge, swimming in shallows.\""
		""
		"&l&eFinally, we wish all players of 『BeLoong』:"
		"&l&eA brilliant future, immediate success, a promising start, and may you leap like a fish transforming into a dragon!"
		""
		"{ \"text\": \"Click to view acknowledgements\", \"underlined\": true, \"color\": green, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"359B897165997027\" } }"
	]
