	quest.61D94A7F289D6DE8.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sneak + Right-click while empty-handed to bind to the current player's dimension network. Dimension network admins can sneak + right-click empty-handed to unbind."
		""
		"&6Used to receive and output FE for the dimension network."
		""
		"&6Right-click to open the energy storage interface and view the network's total energy value. Maximum storage capacity is 2^63."
		""
		"&6Can transfer energy using pipes from other mods, or use the built-in eject mode to output energy to valid blocks on all six sides."
		""
		"&6Maximum transfer rate in eject mode is 2.1 billion FE per tick."
		""
		"&6Eject mode will not output energy directly to other dimension network blocks. An energy channel block with eject mode enabled will also not receive FE energy from external sources."
	]
