	quest.6344D6B5AEC69478.quest_desc: [
		"&aObjective: Collect all Starlight Armor"
		""
		"&6You have defeated the final boss of Eternal Starlight — the &eInfernal Dragon&6,"
		"&6and found that dimensional rift glowing with an eerie green light."
		"&6A nauseating stench of decay drifts constantly from the other world."
		"&6You decide to step through this portal and investigate."
		"&6Perhaps the reason for the Starlight people's disappearance lies within?"
		"&6But before that, you need to polish your equipment."
		"&eStarlight Armor &6from the stars is an excellent choice."
	]
