	quest.6DC97A09E372363A.quest_desc: [
		"&aObjective: Craft and submit a Terraprisma"
		""
		"&6You have defeated all the bosses of &2The Undergarden&6 and obtained six divine swords:"
		"&eQing Ming, Po Shan, Bai Hong, Liu Xing, Long Yuan, Chi Xiao."
		"&6You merge these six swords into one, forging the &bTerraprisma&6."
		"&6The Abyssal Dwellers exchange their clan's treasure, the &dPrimordial Ark&6, for your &bTerraprisma&6,"
		"&6to repel the Corruption's erosion and revitalize The Undergarden."
		""
		"&6At the dawn of creation, the primordial essence coalesced into the &dPrimordial Ark&6."
		"&6This sword possesses the power to split the heavens, its wielder can cross the barriers of worlds."
		"&6The great sword soars, bursting forth with dazzling brilliance, severing the ages!"
		"&6The dimensional rift to another world is torn open, and you step through."
		"&6What lies at the end of the road? You do not know."
		"&6The journey ends here, or does it?"
		""
		"&e【All Main Quests Completed】"
		"{ \"text\": \"Click to view acknowledgements\", \"underlined\": true, \"color\": green, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"359B897165997027\" } }"
	]
	quest.6DC97A09E372363A.quest_subtitle: "【Chapter IV Concluded】"
	quest.6DC97A09E372363A.title: "&e&lPrimordial Ark"
	quest.6E02B2425A8EAB67.quest_desc: [
		"&l&d「Starlight Golem」"
		"&6Health: &a2500"
		"&6Attack: &c???"
		"&6Armor: &70"
		""
		"&l&dSpawn"
		"&6The Starlight Golem spawns at the end of the &9Golem Forge&6."
		"&6The Starlight Golem cannot move and is immune to fire and frost damage."
		"&6All of the Starlight Golem's attacks deal multi-hit continuous damage,"
		"&6so the total damage is often variable under normal circumstances."
		""
		"&9Structure Compass: &b【Eternal Starlight】Golem Forge&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&l&dStrategy"
		"The Starlight Golem initially starts in a Charging state, recharging every 90 seconds thereafter."
		"During charging, the Starlight Golem cannot attack. The 4 surrounding &eEnergy Blocks &rcontinuously charge it, restoring 0.4 health per second."
		"After charging, the Starlight Golem regains 100 energy."
		"&cPlayers must right-click the Energy Blocks to extinguish them; projectiles also work."
		"Once all are extinguished, the Starlight Golem enters a Vulnerable state."
		"In the Vulnerable state, the total damage the Starlight Golem can take cannot exceed 2/3 of its maximum health."
		"When not in the Vulnerable state, the Starlight Golem is immune to all damage."
		"The Starlight Golem can hold up to 100 energy."
		"Each attack consumes a certain amount of energy. Energy consumption cannot go negative. When it reaches 0, the Starlight Golem immediately enters the Charging state."
		"Each time the Starlight Golem is hit by a thrown &eSubzero Cuvette&r, its energy is reduced by 3 points."
		"When the Starlight Golem's remaining health is ≤20%, it loses its passive invincibility and permanently stops switching between Charging and Vulnerable states."
		"From this point on, players can freely attack the Starlight Golem with normal means and deal damage."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&l&dSkills"
		"&l&eLaser"
		"Energy Cost: 50"
		"Inflicts a few seconds of Fire Aspect on hit."
		"Short wind-up. Continuously fires a blue laser in the direction of the current target."
		"The laser slowly tracks the target's movement."
		"This attack slightly breaks low-hardness blocks in its path."
		"&l&eSummon Energy Vents"
		"Energy Cost: 20"
		"High damage frequency, inflicts Fire Aspect on hit."
		"The Starlight Golem summons energy vents at the target's current location and several random locations."
		"Energy vents continuously damage targets within one block above them."
		"Energy vents have a very short duration but appear in large numbers."
		"Players must move to avoid energy vents that may spawn beneath their feet."
		"&l&eGround Slam"
		"Energy Cost: 16"
		"The Starlight Golem raises its arms on the spot and, after a short wind-up, slams the ground in the direction of the target."
		"The shockwave from the slam sends blocks spreading in a cone, damaging all targets in the area."
		"Simultaneously, 5 energy projectiles are scattered forward."
		"These projectiles move slowly but try to track the target's position. They ignore invincibility frames on hit, dealing damage."
		""
		"&o&7Strategy Source: www.mcmod.cn"
	]
	quest.6E02B2425A8EAB67.quest_subtitle: "★★★★"
	quest.6E02B2425A8EAB67.title: "Eternal Starlight: Starlight Golem"
