	quest.6EA867B07E184273.quest_desc: [
		"&6Long ago, the Moonvine clan were the guardians of the Eternal Starlight dimension, maintaining its balance with their lunar power. But a sudden dark storm swept through, devouring most of the Moonvines. The survivors absorbed an excess of chaotic magic, transforming into the terrifying Lunar Monstrosity. It can control tough vines to attack and unleash a lunar curse, now becoming a fearsome presence in the dimension."
		"{ \"text\": \"Click to jump to boss strategy\", \"underlined\": true, \"color\": green, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"17A9978D7AFEA210\" } }"
	]
