	quest.735C8B5A219C57AE.quest_desc: [
		"&aObjective: Learn to use skills, kill 1 Iron Golem"
		""
		"&6Each dragon type has its own unique skills. Click &6Skill Info &fat the top of your inventory."
		"&6A dragon can equip 4 &eActive Skills&6, located at the &ebottom-right corner &6of the screen."
		"&6First press the &d【R】 &6key to select a skill, then hold &d【C】 &6to cast it."
		"&6Using skills consumes &5Mana&6. The dots above the skill icon indicate your mana level."
		"&6Mana &6increases with your &2experience level&6, and skill damage scales similarly."
		""
		"&cNote: If you run out of mana, skills will consume experience points!"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Open your inventory and click the second icon in the top row, &aSkill Info&6."
		"&6You'll see four columns of skills from left to right, explained below."
		""
		"&a1: &dHotbar&6 - The four active skills in the bottom-right corner of the UI; they can be swapped."
		"&a2: &dActive Skills&6 - Drag these to the hotbar to replace skills; their level is tied to experience."
		"&a3: &dPassive Skills&6 - Click the arrow on the right to upgrade them, consuming experience."
		"&a4: &dPassive Traits&6 - Represent the innate characteristics of each dragon type."
		""
		"&cNote: Use the mouse wheel to scroll pages, and hold Shift to view skill details!"
		"{image:kubejs:textures/task/dragon_skill.png width:100 height:80 align:center}"
	]
	quest.735C8B5A219C57AE.quest_subtitle: "Learn to use draconic skills"
	quest.735C8B5A219C57AE.title: "Draconic Magic"
	quest.7374FD45EAC02F8D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Place on top of an &dAethersent Block&6"
		""
		"&6Use a &aCarved Lunaris Cactus Fruit &6to summon it."
		""
		"An anti-air utility creature that only targets specific aerial hostile mobs."
		""
		"In the current version, this only includes Phantoms."
		""
		"When attacking, it has an extremely fast attack speed, very long range, and a large damage area. However, its attacks cannot harm non-aerial mobs."
		""
		"When there are no meteor showers or the above targets, the Aethersent Golem will not retaliate even if attacked by other mobs."
		""
		"When the Aethersent Golem is on the surface and a meteor shower is occurring,"
		""
		"it will shoot down falling meteors mid-air. Destroyed meteors still yield their corresponding items."
		""
		"Heavenly Creepers will also fail to spawn because the meteors are destroyed."
	]
	quest.7374FD45EAC02F8D.quest_subtitle: "Essential Phantom Killer for the Home"
